{"premise_check":[{"premise":"MindMap 利用隐式知识与从 KG 检索的事实来构造推理（mind map）","supported":true,"evidence_eids":["E2","E5","E9"],"note":"原文称 MindMap 整合 KG 检索事实与 LLM 隐式知识，并生成 mind map。"},{"premise":"RoG 使用外部 KG 生成关系路径计划并据以检索推理路径","supported":true,"evidence_eids":["E1","E3","E8","E10"],"note":"原文明确 RoG 以 KG 为 grounding 生成 relation paths 作为 plan，再检索有效路径。"},{"premise":"MindMap 的 mind map 是关系路径计划","supported":false,"evidence_eids":[],"note":"证据中未把 mind map 等同于 RoG 式 relation path plan；MindMap 的 mind map 是基于证据图与推理链合并的 reasoning graph。"},{"premise":"两篇论文的可解释性结论在相同实验条件下可直接比较胜负","supported":false,"evidence_eids":[],"note":"证据未提供二者在同一数据划分、底座模型、指标与协议下的直接比较；不能据共同数据集推断可比胜负。"}],"answer":"MindMap 的做法是让 LLM 理解 KG 输入，“consolidates the retrieved facts from KGs and the implicit knowledge from LLMs”，并“discovers new patterns in input KGs”，再“reasons over the mind map to yield final outputs” [E2]；其目标是“infer with a combination of implicit and external knowledge”，并“elicits the mind map of LLMs, which reveals their reasoning pathways based on the ontology of knowledge” [E5]。这里的 mind map 由证据图上的多条推理链合并为推理图，原文描述为“The mind map combines all the inference chains into a reasoning graph, providing an intuitive understanding of knowledge connections in each step and the sources of evidence sub-graphs” [E6]。

RoG 则把外部 KG 结构用于规划与检索：“RoG first generates relation paths grounded by KGs as faithful plans via the planning module”，随后“These plans are then used to retrieve valid reasoning paths from KGs to conduct faithful reasoning by the retrieval-reasoning module” [E1]。它强调“By treating relation paths as plans, we can make sure the plans are grounded by KGs, which enables LLMs to conduct faithful and interpretable reasoning on graphs” [E8]，并通过规划优化把 KG 知识蒸馏进 LLM 以生成关系路径计划 [E8]。

可解释性边界方面：RoG 的原文声称能“generates faithful and interpretable reasoning results” [E1]，MindMap 的原文声称 mind map“reveals their reasoning pathways”并以图表示 rationale [E5, E9]。但这些是作者主张；证据未给出二者在同一设置下对“可解释性”作同指标直接比较，因此不能据共同数据集或各自声称推断谁更可解释或谁胜出。"}
